                <span style={{ color: "#a78bfa" }}>// AXIS-ALIGNED SPLITS:</span> Each white line is a split. Colour regions show predicted class. Crossed-out points (Γ£ù) are misclassified. Deep trees perfectly partition training points ΓÇö but the jagged boundaries won't generalise.
